      "text": "COSHH 2002 applies to any employer whose workers meet hazardous substances. Regulation 6 asks for an assessment. Regulation 7 asks for control of exposure. Regulation 12 asks for information, instruction and training. Regulation 12 is the one most often missed. The assessment exists, but the worker never sees it."
