      "heading": "What COSHH asks for",
      "html": "<p>COSHH 2002 sits under the Health and Safety at Work Act. It applies to every employer whose workers meet hazardous substances.</p><p>Regulation 6 asks for a suitable and sufficient assessment of the risk. Regulation 7 asks you to prevent or control exposure. Regulation 12 asks for information, instruction and training. It covers the substances, the risks and the controls.</p><p>Regulation 12 is the one field teams most often miss. The assessment is there. The worker has not been told.</p>"
